flow-trial-extension/test/fixtures/private/

# Glance model lab (glance-ai/): regenerated datasets, local envs, and large weights.
# The checked-in int8 JSON and .glw files under glance-ai/model/artifacts and
# glance-ai/model/shadow-pkg/weights are the shadow candidates (each inside the
# on-device budget). They are not this ignore. ONNX, GGUF, LLM checkpoints, and
# anything a generator writes into dataset/out* are.
glance-ai/**/.venv/
glance-ai/**/node_modules/
glance-ai/**/*.gguf
glance-ai/**/*.onnx
glance-ai/**/*.safetensors
glance-ai/**/*.pt
glance-ai/**/*.bin
glance-ai/model/dataset/out/
glance-ai/model/dataset/out-*/
glance-ai/model/train/features-v2/
glance-ai/labeling/dry-run/work/
glance-ai/labeling/dry-run/artifacts/
glance-ai/model/train/*.npz
glance-ai/oss/finetune/data/
glance-ai/oss/finetune/tools/
glance-ai/oss/finetune/gguf/
glance-ai/oss/finetune/runs/
glance-ai/oss/models/
glance-ai/oss/.venv/
glance-ai/model/suggest-save/out/
glance-ai/model/strip/out/
glance-ai/model/shadow-pkg/test/out/
glance-ai/model/shadow-pkg/bench/out/
